			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750730301,
					"content": "*sob* Freedom! Freedom from this prison at last!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730302,
					"content": "This hot air balloon keeps on swaying this way and that. Heh, who knows, perhaps a gust of wind shall come and blow the whole thing down...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730303,
					"content": "Even Granny Itztli would not be able to save us then, I fear.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730304,
					"content": "Who are you, anyway, and how did you wind up here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750730305,
					"content": "Ah, yes, I haven't introduced myself. Call me Conulaf, a trainee priest of the Masters of the Night-Wind...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730306,
					"content": "As the title suggests, I'm currently in training to be a priest. I've stayed within our tribe all my life, so the elders told me, \"why don't you go out and see the world?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730307,
					"content": "And so they kicked me out of the tribe under the guise of training—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730308,
					"content": "Still, I wouldn't call getting caught by hilichurls the good kind of \"seeing the world,\" would you, my savior?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730309,
						750730311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730309,
					"content": "Adventuring on your own's dangerous stuff...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750730310,
					"content": "Indeed, indeed! Were it not for you, I don't know how long I'd have remained trapped in there...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730313,
					"content": "In any case, thank you so much for saving me, my dear savior... Now, after all this wind I've been subjected to, I should head down before giving my continued training more consideration...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730314,
					"content": "I don't have much on me, but in my family, we repay kindness when it is shown to us, so let me give you these!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				},
				{
					"id": 750730311,
					"content": "Well, so long as you're strong enough...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750730312,
					"content": "Heh... I fear you're not fooling me with that. There just aren't many adventurers as strong as you are in this world...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750730313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Conulaf"
				}
			]
		},
